6. OPERATION AND USER RESPONSIBILITY. G2 Boost changes Windows settings, removes files or moves items to the Recycle Bin only on the user's action, with a preview and confirmation, and keeps a copy of the original values of each tweak so it can be reverted. The decision to apply each tweak or cleanup is the user's. Creating a Windows restore point before several changes is recommended.

